&lt;li&gt;2+ years of Engineering recruiting experience in B2B SaaS, with a proven track record of hiring across Full Stack, DevOps, Infrastructure, and AI Research Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of recruitment processes and candidate selection methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple job openings simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong decision-making skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
