&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a full stack engineering on the product eng team you will be working on the most crucial product features to heygen. As a full stack developer you will be expected to take end to end ownership of feature all the way from the frontend to backend API to ML models.&amp;nbsp; You are someone who is passionate about creating impactful AI products, high levels of ownership and growth mindset. &amp;nbsp;Tech Stack: Typescript, react, python, Go&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles_content__YC4eT&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles_description__uLHQ_&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development: Design, develop, test, and deploy robust, scalable, and optimized features for the HeyGen platform across both front-end and back-end components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Work closely with UX/UI designers, product managers, and other engineering teams to deliver a holistic product experience to our users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenance &amp;amp; Optimization: Monitor platform performance, identify bottlenecks, and implement solutions in a timely manner. Ensure the platform remains updated, secure, and compliant with the latest industry standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience in Full Stack Software Development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with React, Javascript, Python, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with RESTful API development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with database systems such as MySQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What HeyGen Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic and inclusive work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and advancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative culture that values innovation and creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the latest technologies and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$180,000 – $215,000 annually&lt;br&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers comprehensive benefits including a 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;styles_content__YC4eT&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles_description__uLHQ_&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Head of Enterprise Marketing to build and lead HeyGen’s enterprise marketing motion, with an initial focus on helping us win the world’s largest and most strategic companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen already has significant organic adoption inside many of the world’s largest enterprises. Our next opportunity is to turn that awareness and usage into deep, strategic enterprise relationships — while proactively breaking into the high-value accounts we want to win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional B2B demand generation role focused on maximizing lead volume. You’ll partner closely with our enterprise sales team to identify the accounts that matter most and develop creative, highly targeted programs that help us engage the right buyers and buying committees within them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be the founding leader of this function, reporting to the CMO. You’ll start as a highly hands-on operator — developing strategy and personally executing programs — with the opportunity to build a team as the motion scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build our strategic account marketing engine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Enterprise Sales to develop and continuously refine our named-account strategy, account tiers, priority industries, and buying committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the ABM playbook for HeyGen from the ground up, defining how Marketing and Sales work together to penetrate and win our highest-value accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep understanding of priority accounts, their business challenges, key stakeholders, existing HeyGen adoption, and signals of buying intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create repeatable account planning and measurement systems that can scale as our enterprise business grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create programs that get us into the accounts that matter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop highly targeted campaigns across paid media, personalized digital experiences, executive programs, field marketing, gifting/direct mail, and other channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create personalized landing pages, pitches, demos, content, and experiences tailored to priority accounts and industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive programs — including intimate dinners, roundtables, VIP events, and executive-to-executive engagement — that create meaningful relationships with senior enterprise buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative ways to surround entire buying committees, reaching champions, decision-makers, influencers, and stakeholders with messaging relevant to their role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment aggressively. Find unconventional ways to get the attention of difficult-to-reach enterprise buyers rather than relying on a standard B2B marketing playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn HeyGen’s existing adoption into an enterprise advantage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Growth, RevOps, Data, and Sales to identify companies already showing meaningful HeyGen adoption and product usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use first-party product signals to identify champions, understand account penetration, prioritize opportunities, and inform account-specific marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop programs that help convert organic product adoption into larger enterprise relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect our PLG and strategic-account motions so that Sales knows where HeyGen already has momentum inside the organizations they’re pursuing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner deeply with Sales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as part of the enterprise GTM team, not as a separate marketing function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with enterprise leadership and AEs to understand what is blocking priority accounts and build marketing programs around those problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide targeted air cover around major opportunities as they progress through the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring account insights and market learnings back into our enterprise strategy and help shape where we focus next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand the motion over time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While our initial focus is strategic enterprise accounts, identify opportunities to apply what works to a broader set of enterprise and mid-market customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine which successful high-touch programs can become repeatable and scalable without sacrificing quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the team, technology, agency relationships, and operating model required as enterprise marketing grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means HeyGen becomes dramatically better at penetrating and winning the enterprise accounts that matter most. Examples include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful growth in engagement and relationships across our highest-priority named accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More meetings and qualified opportunities created within strategic accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased penetration of buying committees, rather than reliance on a single champion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic marketing programs that materially influence enterprise pipeline, deal progression, and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tight operating rhythm between Sales and Marketing around shared account priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A repeatable ABM playbook that can eventually be scaled to a broader enterprise audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear understanding of which enterprise marketing investments actually move accounts — and doubling down aggressively on what works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12+ years of B2B marketing experience, with meaningful experience marketing to large enterprise customers and several years operating at a senior leadership level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record building and executing account-based marketing / strategic account programs that generated measurable enterprise pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-ACV, complex enterprise sales motions involving multiple stakeholders and long sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of modern ABM tactics: targeted paid media, personalized content and experiences, executive programs, field marketing, direct mail/gifting, intent signals, and buying-committee engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely strong partnership instincts with Sales. You think in terms of shared accounts and shared revenue outcomes, not Marketing vs. Sales metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly creative marketer who can figure out how to get the attention of a Fortune 500 executive rather than simply running the standard B2B playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical enough to understand account signals, measure program effectiveness, and make disciplined decisions about where to invest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable spanning strategy and execution. You can present an enterprise marketing strategy to the leadership team in the morning and personally ship a campaign in the afternoon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with broader B2B demand generation is a plus. Over time, this role may expand beyond strategic accounts into more scalable enterprise and mid-market programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a function from an early stage and eventually hiring and leading a small, high-performing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a fast-growing PLG company is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI-Native Mindset&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best operators today are AI-native.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should be deeply fluent in AI tools and comfortable using them to research accounts, understand buying committees, personalize campaigns, create content, analyze performance, and multiply your output. We’re looking for someone who sees AI not simply as something HeyGen sells, but as a fundamental part of how modern marketing should operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$200,000 – $250,000 + equity + benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp; As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers equity, comprehensive benefits including a 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at HeyGen and be part of a team that&#39;s reshaping the world of video creation through innovative technology!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;styles_content__YC4eT&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles_description__uLHQ_&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Head of Strategic Partnerships to make HeyGen the AI avatar &amp;amp; video partner of choice for the world&#39;s leading platforms and AI companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has two priorities. The first is landing distribution partnerships with the largest social, content, and creative platforms, putting HeyGen inside the products where billions of people create and share content. The second is building strategic partnerships with leading AI-native companies across voice, productivity, presentations, legal, and other categories, so that HeyGen is known as one of the defining companies in AI and the company other AI leaders choose to build with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own partnerships end-to-end, from identifying targets and reaching the right executives to structuring, negotiating, and closing deals, and then making them succeed after launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the founding leader of this function, reporting directly to the CMO. You&#39;ll start as a hands-on dealmaker, personally sourcing and closing the first wave of partnerships, with the opportunity to build a team as the function scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Land tier-1 distribution partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize the platforms where a HeyGen integration would reach the most creators, businesses, and users: social and content platforms, creative and productivity tools, and enterprise software suites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with executive, product, and GTM leaders at these companies, and get HeyGen in front of the people who make integration decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and close integration deals, including native in-product integrations, OEM and embedded partnerships, API partnerships, white-label and licensing arrangements, and revenue-share models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product, engineering, and design teams on both sides to prototype integrations, set technical requirements, and ship partner launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build HeyGen&#39;s position in the AI ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop partnerships with leading AI companies across voice, presentations, productivity, legal, and other categories where AI avatars makes their product better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create partnerships with substance: product integrations, joint launches, co-marketing, shared customers, and bundled offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the AI ecosystem closely and move early on the companies that are becoming category leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make HeyGen a visible part of the AI conversation through partner announcements, joint events, and relationships with founders and executives across the industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent HeyGen at industry events and conferences alongside our partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow the HeyGen API as a partner platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify companies that should build HeyGen video into their own products, and bring them onto the HeyGen API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the API product team on partner tiers, terms, and pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the partner program, documentation, and support model that let integrations scale beyond what can be managed one deal at a time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own deals end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full partnership lifecycle: sourcing, pitching, structuring, negotiation, and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design deal structures that align incentives for both sides and protect HeyGen&#39;s long-term position on exclusivity, data, brand, and economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Legal, Finance, Product, and Marketing to finalize agreements and get them launched quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with PR and Marketing to turn major partnerships into launch moments that earn coverage and attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage partners after launch: track performance, run regular business reviews, co-sell with partner GTM teams, and expand the partnerships that work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the function&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set HeyGen&#39;s partnerships strategy, including where we focus and where we don&#39;t, tied to clear revenue and growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how partnerships are prioritized, measured, and reviewed with leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means HeyGen is integrated into the platforms that matter and is seen as one of the companies that leading AI companies choose to partner with. Examples include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live integrations with multiple tier-1 platforms that bring HeyGen to new audiences at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnerships with leading AI companies that result in shipped integrations, joint launches, and shared customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurable reach, usage, and revenue driven by partner channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growing base of companies building on the HeyGen API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnership announcements that earn tier-1 press and strengthen HeyGen&#39;s standing in AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inbound interest from top platforms and AI companies that want to partner with HeyGen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A repeatable partnerships playbook and a pipeline for the next wave of deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in strategic partnerships, business development, or corporate development, with several years in a senior leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of sourcing and closing large partnerships with major technology platforms, such as social, content, creative, or productivity platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OEM, embedded, or platform partnerships that put a company&#39;s technology inside another company&#39;s product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with executive, product, and GTM leaders at major tech platforms and AI companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience structuring complex deals, including integrations, API and platform partnerships, licensing, revenue share, and co-marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving post-deal value: partnerships that grew in usage and revenue after signing, not just closed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough technical fluency to scope integrations with Product and Engineering and talk credibly about APIs, models, and product roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product instincts. You can see how HeyGen fits into a partner&#39;s product and pitch it in terms of their users and their roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive presence and negotiation skills. You&#39;re comfortable across the table from a founder, a platform VP, or a Big Tech partnerships team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable spanning strategy and execution. You can set partnerships strategy with the leadership team and personally run the deal the same week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a function from an early stage and hiring a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a fast-growing AI, platform, or PLG company is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best operators today are AI-native.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should be deeply fluent in both AI tools and the AI ecosystem itself: who the important companies are, what they&#39;re building, and where the category is heading. You should use AI tools every day to research targets, prepare for meetings, draft proposals, analyze partnership performance, and multiply your output. We&#39;re looking for someone who is part of the AI community, not someone watching it from the outside.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: San Francisco Bay Area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;$250,000 – $300,000 + equity + rewards + benefits&lt;br&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp; As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers comprehensive benefits including a 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at HeyGen and be part of a team that&#39;s making visual storytelling accessible to all!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is looking for a proactive, high-ownership IT Systems &amp;amp; Operations Owner to join our team in the Palo Alto, San Francisco or LA office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you won&#39;t just close support tickets—you will own our IT infrastructure, security footprint, and physical workspace operations. You will act as the primary point of contact for all things IT, balancing immediate tactical unblocking with long-term strategic automation. As we scale, you will eventually manage external contractors to support day-to-day tasks, keeping your focus on architecture, cost optimization, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Security &amp;amp; Endpoint Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Protection: Implement and oversee Data Loss Prevention (DLP) frameworks to safeguard company and customer data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Endpoint Security: Manage Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) tooling to monitor, detect, and mitigate workforce security threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access Control: Strictly execute technology onboarding and offboarding, ensuring zero-lag access revocation during departures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tooling, Licensing &amp;amp; Next-Gen IT&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS Management: Provision, manage, and audit user access across our entire corporate software stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Workforce Administration: Manage the deployment and compliance of &quot;AI employees&quot; and automated workflows integrated into our business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cost Ownership: Act as a financial steward by auditing license utilization and identifying opportunities to optimize software spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Office Operations &amp;amp; Engineering Collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace Infrastructure: Maintain physical office IT hardware, equipment, and conference room media setups in our Bay Area hubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-Leverage Support: Act as the strategic layer for employee onboarding infrastructure; guide teammates on setting up environments rather than troubleshooting basic helpdesk queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Implementation: Partner closely with our core engineering teams to test and deploy custom, internal IT automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Experience: 5+ years of experience in IT operations, systems administration, or a similar high-ownership IT role, preferably within a fast-scaling tech startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Foundation: Proven experience configuring and managing EDR systems and implementing DLP policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Project Management: Experience acting as a primary point of contact for vendors, with the demonstrated ability to eventually manage external contractors or support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Traits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Based in the San Francisco Bay Area&amp;nbsp; or LA with the ability to work regularly from the office to manage hardware and conference room infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias for Action: You are obsessive about unblocking users quickly, prioritizing a seamless internal user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation Mindset: You look at every manual process and ask, &lt;em&gt;&quot;How can we make this self-serve?&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourcefulness: You know how to leverage internal software engineers to build solutions, while independently managing vendors and contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What HeyGen Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic and inclusive work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and advancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative culture that values innovation and creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the latest technologies and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;$120,000 – 180,000 annually&lt;br&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers comprehensive benefits including a 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring Mid-Market Account Executives to help accelerate adoption of HeyGen across growing mid-sized companies. This is a full-cycle closing role with a heavy emphasis on self-sourced pipeline. You will identify high-potential accounts, run creative outbound campaigns, qualify opportunities, lead discovery, demo the product, build consensus across buying groups, manage deal cycles, and close new business. Mid-market sits between high-velocity commercial selling and traditional enterprise. Deals are larger and involve more stakeholders than a commercial sale, but they still need to move fast. We are looking for closers who can run a structured, multi-stakeholder sales process while keeping the pace, urgency, and creativity of a hunter. You will sell both the HeyGen web app and HeyGen API, helping customers understand how AI video can transform marketing, sales enablement, customer education, training, localization, product onboarding, and developer-powered video workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build your own pipeline -&lt;/strong&gt; You will run high-volume, high-quality outbound into target mid-market accounts. This includes cold email, phone, LinkedIn, personalized video, account research, trigger-based outreach, and creative campaign ideas. You should be excited by the idea of finding your own opportunities, not waiting for perfect inbound leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the full sales cycle - &lt;/strong&gt;You will manage opportunities from first touch to close. That includes prospecting, qualification, discovery, product demos, business-case development, security reviews, negotiation, legal/procurement coordination, and handoff to Customer Success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run multi-stakeholder deals -&lt;/strong&gt; Most deals will involve several people: a business champion, an economic buyer, a technical evaluator, and often security or procurement. You will map the buying group early, build consensus, and keep every stakeholder moving toward a decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell business outcomes, not just AI features -&lt;/strong&gt; You will help customers understand how HeyGen can reduce video production costs, speed up content creation, improve localization, personalize customer communication, and unlock new video workflows that were not possible before. You will build business cases with a clear return that a budget holder can sign off on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell across web app and API use cases -&lt;/strong&gt; Some customers will want to use HeyGen directly through the web app. Others may want to integrate HeyGen into their own product, platform, workflow, or internal system using APIs. You do not need to be an engineer, but you should be technically curious and comfortable explaining technical concepts in simple business language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move fast and create urgency - &lt;/strong&gt;Mid-market cycles are longer than a commercial deal, but they should never drift. You will keep deals moving, create momentum with busy buyers, ask direct questions, uncover pain, tie pain to business impact, and drive clear next steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with PLG, growth, product, and customer teams -&lt;/strong&gt; You will work with product-led growth signals, self-serve users, product usage data, customer requests, and inbound interest to identify expansion and conversion opportunities. Maintain strong pipeline discipline - You will keep CRM data clean, forecast accurately, manage next steps, and understand the difference between real pipeline and hopeful pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of B2B SaaS sales experience, including at least 4 years in a closing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of meeting or exceeding quota selling into mid-market companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience generating a meaningful portion of your own pipeline through outbound prospecting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running multi-stakeholder sales cycles, including business cases, security reviews, and procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery skills and the ability to connect product capabilities to business pain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort selling to marketing, sales, customer success, L&amp;amp;D, product, operations, IT, finance, or technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-agency, builder mindset. You do not wait for perfect playbooks. You test, learn, and iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication skills. Your outbound emails, follow-ups, proposals, and deal recaps should be clear, sharp, and persuasive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about AI, video, creative workflows, and API-driven products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling PLG, usage-based, API, developer platform, creative software, marketing technology, sales technology, or AI products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into marketing, localization, customer education, learning and development, sales enablement, ecommerce, media, or product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning team-level or departmental usage into larger, company-wide contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using video, personalization, or creative outbound to source opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an early-stage or high-growth startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Will Thrive Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gets energy from prospecting and hunting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can write a sharp cold email without waiting for marketing to give you a template.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is comfortable making calls, sending videos, testing messaging, and following up persistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can keep a deal with five or six stakeholders moving without losing pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can take a new product category and figure out where buyers feel urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Does not need a fully built sales playbook to be productive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can sell to both business users and technical evaluators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is competitive, resourceful, and organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knows how to balance speed with thoughtful qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary plus uncapped commission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity in a high-growth AI company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, and vision benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to help define a new category in AI video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership, high velocity, and direct impact on revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We value diversity and are committed to building an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;SQtBdkUnvo9w3ExV01NuCKOEs7f&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
