&lt;div class=&quot;styles_description__uLHQ_&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;SQtBdkUnvo9w3ExV01NuCKOEs7f&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jd79dJeJGoYzuxxw3s4u9YTtsoh&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;SQtBdkUnvo9w3ExV01NuCKOEs7f&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jd79dJeJGoYzuxxw3s4u9YTtsoh&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen&#39;s marketing site is the first thing most people see of the product, and one of the highest-leverage growth surfaces we have. Every landing page, pricing page, and signup flow either turns curiosity into an activated user or loses them. We&#39;re hiring a Web Product Designer to own that surface end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a marketing-site role first, but not a brand or visual design role. We want someone who has done this work and has worked as a product designer, someone who thinks in funnels, ships experiments, reads the data, and iterates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own HeyGen&#39;s marketing surface end to end, working directly with Growth, Marketing, and Web Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join an elite design team with emphasis on ownership, speed and impact, where you decide what gets tested and not just how it looks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship to a site with enough traffic that a hypothesis gets answered in days, and build in code with AI as a core part of the workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Web Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the design of HeyGen&#39;s marketing site from concept to production-ready spec. Homepage, product and feature pages, pricing, campaign landing pages, templates, SEO pages, and the handoff into signup and onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Growth, Marketing, and Web Engineering as a true product partner rather than a ticket-taker. Help decide what to test, not just how it looks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and ship A/B tests and landing page variants. Form hypotheses, define success metrics, read the results, and carry the learnings forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversion and Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve top-of-funnel conversion and the transition into the product through signup, first-run, and activation. Understand how the site connects to retention, not just clicks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concept and Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Create high-quality concept work, including exploratory directions, bold hero moments, motion, and storytelling that make the product feel as good as it is.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile-First and Responsive:&lt;/strong&gt; Design mobile-first and responsive by default. Desktop and mobile are both first-class.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Use Claude Code, Codex, or equivalent tools as a core part of your workflow to prototype in code, explore more directions faster, and push designs to production quality without waiting on a handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Systems and Consistency:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and extend the site&#39;s design system so pages ship fast without eroding quality, and work with the broader design team to keep the site and the product feeling like one HeyGen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of designing and shipping modern software and web experiences. More is great. Less is fine if the work is exceptional and you&#39;re hungry, we care about output and drive more than a résumé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing marketing sites in production that had to perform, with a clear understanding of the difference between a page that looks good and a page that converts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as a product designer, embedded with PMs and engineers, shipping features and living with the consequences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of designing for metrics-driven outcomes, fluent in A/B testing, conversion rate, activation, retention, and top-of-funnel versus bottom-of-funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in visual design, with an insightful understanding of fundamental design elements like typography, layout, color, and motion, and the ability to take a blank canvas and bring a point of view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, building components and patterns rather than one-off pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in AI-assisted design. Very comfortable with Claude Code, Codex, or the equivalent, and able to get production-grade output from it, real shippable web pages rather than rough demos. You treat these tools as a multiplier on your craft and judgment, not a replacement for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile and responsive design as second nature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, high velocity, and iterating in public. We ship constantly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication. You can articulate why a design decision is right, and change your mind when the data says otherwise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open-minded, self-driven, strong learner, constantly on the front edge of the industry, bringing the latest insights to the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;$180,000 – $235,000 annually depending on experience and fit. Not representative of total compensation which includes equity and benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp; As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers comprehensive benefits including internal equity, a matching 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
